WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.710
- I was like you.

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:05.022
I decided it'd be cool to hang out

00:00:05.022 --> 00:00:06.611
with some of the tough kids.

00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:07.830
(grunting)

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.540
You know who I'm talking about?

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.873
They were hanging on the
streets late at night.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:17.280
More than cigarette smokers, Homes.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.113
And then

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:20.753
one day

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.250
I got shot out of a catapult.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.872
- That's it.

00:00:24.872 --> 00:00:29.517
(cell door closing and slamming)

00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:31.710
- Now I know this plan is foolproof.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:32.553
Check this out.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:37.680
First of all, you and me
start working at the bank.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.910
Doesn't matter the position, okay?

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.400
Just so long as we get in there, right?

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.680
Then we just go there every day,

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.000
do the work,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.600
gain their trust until we get
them in the palm of our hand.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.220
- All right?

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.570
So how we get the money?

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.730
- That's the beauty of it, bro.

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.200
They deposit the money

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.630
into our bank accounts.

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.850
Week after week, month after month.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.370
They're not even going to
know they being robbed.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.262
And then 20 or 30 years later,

00:01:05.262 --> 00:01:10.262
we walk out the front door
like nothing even happened.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:17.133
- Mother (beep) that's called a job.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.788
(cell door slamming)
(alarm ringing)

00:01:20.788 --> 00:01:21.746
(upbeat music)

00:01:21.746 --> 00:01:24.402
- Here.
(tires screeching)

00:01:24.402 --> 00:01:25.235
- Shit.

00:01:25.235 --> 00:01:26.068
- What are you doing?

00:01:26.068 --> 00:01:26.901
Come on.

00:01:26.901 --> 00:01:30.123
- Wait, I'm coming.
(engine revving)

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.323
(tires screeching)
Stay where you are.

00:01:31.323 --> 00:01:33.371
- What are you doing?

00:01:33.371 --> 00:01:35.501
Stop, thank you.

00:01:35.501 --> 00:01:37.410
(handle clunking)
(lock clicking)

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.430
- You're not locking it.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.063
- We're doing it at the
same time is the problem.

00:01:40.063 --> 00:01:41.490
- Unlock the door.

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:42.690
- No,

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:44.400
now.
(handle clunking)

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:45.398
Stop touching it while I do the lock.

00:01:45.398 --> 00:01:46.530
- What do you want me to do?

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:47.477
- Just do it now.

00:01:47.477 --> 00:01:48.450
(handle clunking)

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:49.422
Unbelievable.

00:01:49.422 --> 00:01:50.255
- You're kidding me.

00:01:50.255 --> 00:01:51.120
- Stop it and reset.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.800
Put it down.
- I'm just holding it.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.540
- Take your hand off.
- It is on the thing.

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:55.980
- I got to reset the thing.

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:56.973
Look, look at this, huh?
(lock clunking)

00:01:56.973 --> 00:01:58.772
Huh, nothing happens if
you're holding it up.

00:01:58.772 --> 00:02:01.150
Everybody knows not to do that.

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:01.989
'Cause now it's all jiggered
(growling)

00:02:01.989 --> 00:02:02.834
in the middle.

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:04.892
You've got it all jiggered
in the middle now.

00:02:04.892 --> 00:02:05.841
(groaning)
Stop.

00:02:05.841 --> 00:02:06.870
- What?
- Take your hand

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.120
