00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.346
Thank you.

00:02:10.346 --> 00:02:11.929
(lever shifting)
(tires screeching)

00:02:11.929 --> 00:02:13.270
- Christ, you are going to get...

00:02:14.525 --> 00:02:15.425
What happened?

00:02:15.425 --> 00:02:16.926
What happened though, what happened?

00:02:16.926 --> 00:02:17.812
I don't know what happened.

00:02:17.812 --> 00:02:18.781
(cell door slamming)

00:02:18.781 --> 00:02:20.061
(fist punching face)

00:02:20.061 --> 00:02:22.950
(heavy breathing)

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.030
- Please.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:24.863
No, no.

00:02:26.197 --> 00:02:27.262
No.
(gun shooting)

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:29.458
(bullet shell hitting floor)

00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:31.708
(laughing)

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:37.517
