00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:43.590
- What?

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:44.515
- I don't get it.

00:02:44.515 --> 00:02:47.120
- Man, you shot that damn fool.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:49.370
(laughing)

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:51.683
