right out my ass.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.430
So I hope, like,

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.684
I hope that's like
lifetime dudes right there.

00:06:04.684 --> 00:06:06.180
What's up.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:09.060
It's the happiest day of my
